flowchart TD
    Human[Dustin / operator] --> Console[Local webshell or console]
    Kernel[K.E.R.N.E.L. / OpenClaw] --> SSH[OpenSSH to dedicated automation identity]
    Console --> WARPi[WARPi Raspberry Pi]
    SSH --> WARPi

    WARPi --> State[/run/warpi/state.json]
    WARPi --> KernelSvc[warpi-kernel.service]
    WARPi --> UiSvc[warpi-ui.service]
    WARPi --> GPS[GPSD / u-blox GPS]
    WARPi --> Wireless[Wireless adapters]
    WARPi --> Tools[Approved security tooling]
    WARPi --> Mission[Mission Control health/API]

    KernelSvc --> State
    State --> Status[warpi-status / kernel-report]
    State --> Display[TFT display state]
    Status --> Kernel

    Nano[WiFi Pineapple NANO] -. optional future backend .-> WARPi

